## Rows skipped

es-a #27. The row asks to turn Q16–Q20 (and the same pattern in 005, 006, 008, 009) into new headings and to drop the U+200B spacer lines. ACCEPTED-ROUND forbids adding headings. Those lines are blocks the checker counts against the Korean source (a line that is only U+200B is not empty whitespace). Removing them or promoting them to ## would fail headings or blocks. First-person wording inside those blocks was still rewritten under a#26. 006 had no other row, so that file is unchanged.

es-a #36, the deletion only. See a#36. The row remains.

## Systemic patterns and how many instances changed

es-a
- Missing comma that splits a yes/no: 1 (the guidance FAQ). No second «se acepta o no se decide».
- Legal qualifier «extranjero» dropped: 1 (005).
- U+200B blog spacers: 0 removed (structural). Present in 003 Q16–Q20, 005, 006, 008, 009.
- English office name inside a Spanish sentence: 2 (bio + experience).
- Blog first person / usted switch: 7 blocks (008 opening, the table lead-in, «Le contaré»; 003 «Las aseguradoras», «no conviene», the close, «cabe señalar»).
- Digit glued into «1 año»: 4, rewritten as «un año» so the checker still sees 1.

es-b
- Calque ver / examinar / confirmar / valorar + «juntos», including the ungrammatical singular+juntos: 44 rewrites across 002, 003, 004, 007, 010, 011, 012, 014, 016 (plus «El tercer factor ve» and «La primera se ve centrada»). Left as ordinary Spanish: «laboran juntos», «comparecer juntos», «juntos en el mismo espacio», «ambos conceptos juntos», and «pueden ordenarse juntos» in the mediation sentence (they are together in the same room or the same act, not «consider together»).
- English operational verbs: 3 («operarse», «concluirse como», «dispositivo»). «concluirse en 6 meses» and «modo de operar» mean finish / run a business and were left.
- Spain-only road words: 6 (turismos, motorista, intermitente ×4).
- Noun-stack headlines and a paragraph ending on a comma: 6 titles (12 alt/link strings) in 010, and 2 blocks in 013.
- Masculine «por sí mismo» with a missing or feminine subject: 5 (011 ×4, 017 ×1).
- «material de propósito educativo»: 3 (014, 016, 007).
- «elemento internacional»: 5 strings → «elemento de extranjería».

R2–R10 already in the Spanish pack and columns (country note on the Korea tax agreement, «Corea, por ejemplo», emergency 119/110/112, feminine abogada, NUESTRO EQUIPO, OFICINAS, «Perfil completo (en inglés)», Spanish dates, «» and 1.000 / 0,5) were checked and not rewritten again. TWD 1.57M was not touched. Frontmatter url values with Hangul were not touched.

